monetary_boundary = "The real ABI host stages principal-funded 402LXP requests with both scoped account writes; the enclosing kernel activity owns balance mutation and publishes the storage candidate only after settlement. The hermetic integration proof asserts actual host-produced transfer effects and denial rollback, without replacing the kernel with a ledger."
